visibility":"public"},{"canonical_text":"In OGBN-Arxiv node classification, QGCN attains an accuracy of 72.3 ± 1.6 with 43.5K parameters, while GCN attains an accuracy of 72.8 ± 1.5 with 145.1K parameters.","content_hash":"85aa7bdb02c3304f023f42fad2b3655e4546fc800d3e7eca545791af6bae0488","current_step":5,"external_ids":[],"first_seen_step":2,"incoming_reasoning":[],"knowledge_id":"claim_E_imported_15","languages":[],"non_reasoning_links":[],"outgoing_reasoning":["lcs_0f2fafb498fd2ade","lcs_c3c824e0a480ac10","operator_equivalence_Eclaim_15_Oclaim_15"],"search_text":"claim_E_imported_15 In OGBN-Arxiv node classification, QGCN attains an accuracy of 72.3 ± 1.6 with 43.5K parameters, while GCN attains an accuracy of 72.8 ± 1.5 with 145.1K parameters.","source_anchor_ids":["anchor_claim_15","anchor_paragraph_p0062"],"title":null,"type":"claim","visibility":"public"},{"canonical_text":"For OGBG-COLLAB link prediction, QGCN attains a Hits@50 of 45.80 ± 1.35 with 6.4K parameters, whereas GCN attains a Hits@50 of 44.02 ± 1.57 with 12.5K parameters.","content_hash":"9fe0445cc8bdea5b7d5ff3b6ee564a0b7c6de843abec3584710f8fe5947afaa4","current_step":5,"external_ids":[],"first_seen_step":2,"incoming_reasoning":[],"knowledge_id":"claim_E_imported_16","languages":[],"non_reasoning_links":[],"outgoing_reasoning":["lcs_a5e9bfef2f3a9073","lcs_c3c824e0a480ac10","operator_equivalence_Eclaim_16_Oclaim_16"],"search_text":"claim_E_imported_16 For OGBG-COLLAB link prediction, QGCN attains a Hits@50 of 45.80 ± 1.35 with 6.4K parameters, whereas GCN attains a Hits@50 of 44.02 ± 1.57 with 12.5K parameters.","source_anchor_ids":["anchor_claim_16","anchor_paragraph_p0065"],"title":null,"type":"claim","visibility":"public"},{"canonical_text":"For node classification on Cora, real GCN attains an accuracy of 85.2 ± 1.3 with 140.5K parameters, whereas QGCN attains an accuracy of 84.1 ± 1.5 with 42.1K parameters.","content_hash":"bf584e97f9047d1c330f4d02257e0a764f353c9abd19d977c8ab91101021a38f","curre